# Production is standalone (no Cursor)

CrickHerose (nvr-io) runs on GitHub + Vercel + Neon. **Cursor is not part of the live app.** Staff use https://nvr-io-web.vercel.app only. The API is https://nvr-io-api.vercel.app. No Cursor session, hook, agent, or CLI is required for login, collections, or day-to-day use.

Do not add Cursor URLs, MCP, Origin, automations, or agent callbacks to web, API, or Android.

If first-party code changes in this repo:

1. Commit safe files (never `.env`, secrets, `*.db`, `.vercel`).
2. `git push origin main` — Vercel Git integration builds production. Do not require Cursor to keep the app alive.
3. Optional: `npm run ship`

Live URLs:
- Web: https://nvr-io-web.vercel.app
- API: https://nvr-io-api.vercel.app
- Repo: https://github.com/ameenruks33-cyber/nvr-io
